{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/841610-soundtrack-music-to-accompany-the-fall","id":841610,"title":"[Soundtrack] Music to accompany the Fall","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-03T17:46:37-08:00","id":841610,"title":"[Soundtrack] Music to accompany the Fall","content":"List your soundtracks and musical inspirations. I figured we'd do a new thread since it's a new year and folks have had more opportunity to put together their soundtracks.<br /> <br /> <b>Invocation Array</b><br /> I've been listening to this group a bunch lately, and their music is about perfect for <b>Demon</b>. A lot of it speaks to techgnostic imagery and themes perfect for stories of the Unchained. Here's a link to the album playlist on YouTube:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p2XL-lBhUxo&amp;list=PL_xTtBS_u9Ec4Pv47XU-AH5alm5NlvGSj\" data-code=\"p2XL-lBhUxo\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/p2XL-lBhUxo/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Personal favorites are Little Dark Star, Void Indulgent, and Overdrive.<br /> <br /> I have other suggestions, but I'll give other folks a chance to add their own as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-04T08:16:48-08:00","id":841902,"title":"","content":"I run a YouTube channel that I compile mood music playlists for the local games I play. Here is the mood music playlist I've compiled for Demon:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/w8KQmps-Sog?list=PLkuNWc_5RxvjNbaeNpdGAgQmWDyDQS9Qa\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/w8KQmps-Sog?list=PLkuNWc_5RxvjNbaeNpdGAgQmWDyDQS9Qa\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/w8KQmps-Sog?list=PLkuNWc_5RxvjNbaeNpdGAgQmWDyDQS9Qa\" target=\"_blank\"> https://youtu.be/w8KQmps-Sog?list=PLkuNWc_5RxvjNbaeNpdGAgQmWDyDQS9Qa </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1310-samare","name":"Samare","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1310_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-04T15:45:25-08:00","id":842192,"title":"","content":"Here is my youtube playlist for demon as well:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLhmaaivsiTeeyLCzmroWuWcwFXKdAU8G-\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/playlist?lis...WuWcwFXKdAU8G-</a><br /> <br /> Some Specific Notes:<br /> <br /> Daft Punk's Human After All is for the epilogue to my game, after they get to settle into the world (works for Promethean that way too).<br /> Flux Pavallion's Cracks and Nightcore's Monster are from two of the players' Fall soundtracks.<br /> And Eyes on Fire by Blue Foundation is the theme for an Exile antagonist that was caused by the Cracks Demons Fall.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":1329,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","user":"ElvesofZion","date":". 03-04-2016, 07:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-23T14:50:06-07:00","id":872653,"title":"","content":"You're gonna go far, Kid by the Offspring is a really good Demons song I find. So is Devils Never Cry ( for a former Hunter angel). Though really, I personally do not make use of soundtracks that much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-02T07:47:35-07:00","id":880160,"title":"","content":"This one's probably quite a bit obscure, but the song Formless Living Bodies from the OST of the game RayCrisis has always stuck out to me as fitting the God-Machine itself perfectly. It's dark, ominous, mechanical, like the Machine itself, and quite atmospheric and dramatic. It can also fit scenes involving Infrastructure and the like.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_Yiinj_m3gs\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_Yiinj_m3gs\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_Yiinj_m3gs </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_Yiinj_m3gs\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_Yiinj_m3gs </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11208-thehailstormer","name":"TheHailStormer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11208_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T06:36:41-07:00","id":881727,"title":"","content":"Secrets From The Underground by The Offspring ( again.. what can I say, they inspire me to do a lot of Demon things) is a good song for a particularly violent ( heh) ring of Saboteurs. A promise that tomorrow will rock and burn if things don't change indeed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1686,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","user":"Korogra","date":". 05-04-2016, 09:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","